# shell: desktop
# CW-042/FS-009/CW-035: three items the menus offered and enabled, and that
# nothing carried out -- picked, they did nothing at all.
wait 6
note Create link makes a link beside the item, named after it
click-row 1
wait 3
press-row 1 3
wait 2
release-row 1 3
wait 5
menu-pick Create link
wait 30
expect-link /tmp/trk_script/a.txt link /tmp/trk_script/a.txt
note Identify re-asks what a thing IS.  The type table is read at startup,
note so a file whose type the table learned since then is still listed under
note the old one until something goes back and looks.
click-row 1
wait 2
click-row 2 1 ctrl
wait 2
press-row 2 3
wait 2
release-row 2 3
wait 5
menu-pick Identify
wait 8
expect-status identified 2 items
note Select… opens the window its keyboard shortcut opens
press 300 300 3
wait 2
release 300 300 3
wait 5
menu-pick Select…
wait 8
expect-title Select
quit
